<div class=\"relative mt-7 aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"Holding a Room Clubhouse on Startup Topics 🤏🤏\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fdefinition-of-startup.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2>Clubhouse Room with Title: Friendly Talk About Startups and How to Commercialize Ideas 🤏🤏</h2>\n<h4>On November 5, 2021, we held a room on Clubhouse about commercializing <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/invest/\" rel=\"noopener\">startups</a> from idea to commercialization</h4>\n<h4>This was our first experience with Persian rooms for holding a specialized room on this topic</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/Screenshot_۲۰۲۱۱۰۲۷-۲۰۰۰۴۱_Clubhouse-e1635359307196-186x300.jpg\"Clubhouse Room – Startup\n<h4>One of the most attractive business topics currently is the startup world, as startups are famous for their financial appeal and high risk-taking.</h4>\n<h4>The usual definition that can be imagined for a startup is the beginning of a new and emerging business with innovative ideas, with the condition that its failure or success becomes very quickly apparent.</h4>\n<h4>To create a <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d8%a8%d9%88%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%b1-%d9%81%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%b4-%d8%b4%d8%af%d9%81%d8%aa-%d8%a7%d9%86%da%af%db%8c%d8%b2/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a>, there are stages such as ideation, <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%b4%d8%a8%da%a9%d9%87-%d8%b3%d8%a7%d8%b2%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a8%d8%a7%d8%b7%d8%a7%d8%aa/\" rel=\"noopener\">team building</a>, brand registration, attracting investors, etc.</h4>\n<h4>Startups always have challenges, including how long they can last after entering the market.</h4>\n<h4>There is a lot of talk about <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%af%d8%b9%d9%88%d8%aa-%d8%a8%d9%87-%d9%87%d9%85%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d9%be%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%b6%d9%87-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%a2%d9%be%db%8c/\" rel=\"noopener\">startups</a>, and we benefited from various experts in the room we organized</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/Screenshot_۲۰۲۱۱۰۲۷-۱۹۴۹۴۶_Clubhouse-e1635359383113-270x300.jpg\"Clubhouse – Startup\n<h4>We benefited from it</h4>\n<h4>These rooms will continue and we will try to share our experiences.</h4>\n<h4>Thank you, Mehrdad</h4></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:from-violet-700 hover:to-fuchsia-700\" href=\"/mvp-sprint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>See the MVP Sprint</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl border border-violet-500/40 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-violet-700 transition-colors hover:bg-violet-500/10 dark:text-violet-300\" href=\"/contact\">Or tell me about your idea<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 rtl:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><form noValidate=\"\" class=\"mt-4 border-t border-violet-500/20 pt-4\"><label for=\"lead-email\" class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground\">P